Place your model.tflite and scaler_values.json files in this directory before building.

Expected format:
  model.tflite       — TensorFlow Lite model (float32 input, softmax output)
  scaler_values.json — {"mean": [...], "scale": [...]} arrays matching model input size

The app will auto-detect the model's input feature size and adjust the audio feature
extraction pipeline accordingly. Output class labels default to:
  ["Angry", "High Stress", "Low Stress", "Neutral", "Soft"]
